From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrei Aldea <andrei1998@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 10:56:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] video: add BeagleBadge e-paper splash

Add an explicitly board-selected, dithered 400x300 welcome image and
wait for asynchronous display refreshes so the splash reaches the panel
before the boot menu redraws it.

Keep the artwork behind CONFIG_VIDEO_BEAGLEBADGE_LOGO so enabling the
generic SSD16xx driver does not add BeagleBadge branding to other boards.

Developed with assistance from OpenAI Codex.

Signed-off-by: Andrei Aldea <andrei1998@gmail.com>
---
 MAINTAINERS                      |    6 +
 configs/am62lx_badge_defconfig   |    1 +
 drivers/video/Kconfig            |    7 +
 drivers/video/Makefile           |    1 +
 drivers/video/beaglebadge_logo.c | 1484 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/video/beaglebadge_logo.h |    8 +
 drivers/video/ssd16xx.c          |    6 +
 drivers/video/video-uclass.c     |   39 +-
 include/video.h                  |   11 +
 9 files changed, 1561 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/video/beaglebadge_logo.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/video/beaglebadge_logo.h

diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index 1a31a409..49672da1 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -960,6 +960,12 @@ R:	Aspeed BMC SW team <BMC-SW@aspeedtech.com>
 S:	Maintained
